<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>as i wave goodbye</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">LOVERCORE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3NsnczRs7xsd7gx89w5Ufo</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.640" end="00:14.230">Come a little closer, I see passion in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.230" end="00:18.920">You told me you have sinned, well, I can be your sacrifice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.920" end="00:23.260">Mix it with the liquor, now I'm losing track of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.260" end="00:27.710">You place your hand in mine in such a way I can't deny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.710" end="00:31.420">And I know it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.420" end="00:36.680">I couldn't stop myself from hurting you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.680" end="00:40.620">And, yes, I know it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.620" end="00:46.020">I couldn't stop myself, myself, myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.020" end="00:48.440">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.440" end="00:50.750">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.750" end="00:54.510">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.510" end="00:56.890">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.890" end="01:01.560">I enter the room, there's sex in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.560" end="01:06.080">Mixed with perfume and a guilty cigarette</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.080" end="01:10.810">She falls for my charm, I'm filled with regret</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.810" end="01:16.460">But I've gone too far as she pulls me in again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.460" end="01:18.860">Again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.860" end="01:23.180">Again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.180" end="01:26.910">And I know it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.910" end="01:32.080">I couldn't stop myself from hurting you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.080" end="01:36.120">And, yes, I know it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.120" end="01:41.650">I couldn't stop myself, myself, myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.650" end="01:43.940">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.940" end="01:46.300">As you wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.300" end="01:50.840">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.840" end="01:53.200">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.200" end="01:55.500">As you wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.500" end="01:59.240">As I wave goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.240" end="02:03.900">Oh, and I know it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.900" end="02:09.180">I couldn't stop myself from hurting you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.180" end="02:13.140">And, yes, I know it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.140" end="02:17.140">I couldn't stop myself, myself, myself</p></div></body></tt>